  check_read (sys_input segs ms x8)
    (fd32 (ms_gpr ms 0)) (ms_gpr ms 1) (ms_gpr ms 2)
    (mkEffect (Z_to_bv 64 0) [] []) model
    = CheckOk model [].
Proof.
